From: Kimmy <yucheng.or@isrc.iscas.ac.cn>
Subject: [PATCH] chatbot: treat error response bodies as plain text

Avoid interpreting server response bodies as format strings and satisfy
modern go vet checks for non-constant fmt.Errorf formats.

--- a/chatbot/chatbot_replier.go
+++ b/chatbot/chatbot_replier.go
@@ -66,7 +66,7 @@
 			return err
 		}
 
-		return fmt.Errorf(string(responseJsonBody))
+		return fmt.Errorf("%s", responseJsonBody)
 	}
 
 	return nil
